{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:group-import-and-membership:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "group-import-and-membership", "index": 1, "text": "Group and group-membership records store canonical group identity, provider-native kind, display name, URL, optional parent group, and observation time; an issue may hold several memberships and unknown kinds are kept under their provider name.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:group-import-and-membership:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "group-import-and-membership", "index": 2, "text": "The import command accepts one group and expands it to current members under the existing issue bound; an oversized group fails before output, nested groups are not expanded transitively, and unresolvable members are reported.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:group-import-and-membership:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "group-import-and-membership", "index": 3, "text": "Membership is refreshed by sync reads as observations only and never creates dependencies, alters run scope, suspends writes, or changes scope digests.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:group-import-and-membership:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "group-import-and-membership", "index": 4, "text": "A cross-run group index in the state-root registry lists which runs touched each member.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:group-import-and-membership:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "group-import-and-membership", "index": 5, "text": "Coverage exists for Jira parent, sprint, and fix version; Linear project, initiative, cycle, milestone, and parent; and GitHub milestone, sub-issue parent, and issue type.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": true, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:delivery-manifest-and-plan:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "delivery-manifest-and-plan", "index": 1, "text": "A successful run yields a manifest with run and repository identities, source branch, base branch and SHA, accepted tip, per-task accepted commits and evidence references, complete issue binding groups, disclosure policy, and digest, verified against Git using the existing recovery invariants.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:delivery-manifest-and-plan:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "delivery-manifest-and-plan", "index": 2, "text": "A run that is not fully successful, has missing review evidence, or whose managed branch diverged cannot produce a manifest.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:delivery-manifest-and-plan:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "delivery-manifest-and-plan", "index": 3, "text": "The plan command lists repositories, refs, SHAs, PR actions, issue targets, and externally visible text with an evidence digest and expiry, and contains no credentials.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:delivery-manifest-and-plan:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "delivery-manifest-and-plan", "index": 4, "text": "Closing keywords in accepted commit messages are detected and reported without rewriting commits.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:delivery-manifest-and-plan:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "delivery-manifest-and-plan", "index": 5, "text": "For delivery-enabled runs, preflight fetches the configured target and fails before model work when the local starting revision differs, without altering the user's checkout.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:publication-preconditions-and-push:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "publication-preconditions-and-push", "index": 1, "text": "Publication acquires the repository lock, confirms no active supervisor, verifies the managed branch still matches the manifest, and resolves the Git remote and provider repository to the same identity.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:publication-preconditions-and-push:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "publication-preconditions-and-push", "index": 2, "text": "The configured base is fetched; normal advancement from the recorded starting base is permitted, and rewritten or unrelated target history is rejected as base-changed without rebase, model call, or transplant.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:publication-preconditions-and-push:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "publication-preconditions-and-push", "index": 3, "text": "The run ref is pushed with an atomic create-only precondition; an existing ref at the expected tip is idempotent success, and any other tip, including a fast-forwardable ancestor, is a conflict.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:publication-preconditions-and-push:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "publication-preconditions-and-push", "index": 4, "text": "The remote tip is read back after an uncertain push before any further write, and no existing ref, target branch, or unrelated ref is ever updated or deleted.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:publication-preconditions-and-push:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "publication-preconditions-and-push", "index": 5, "text": "Publication authorization is recorded durably before the first remote write.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:draft-pr-create-and-reconcile:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "draft-pr-create-and-reconcile", "index": 1, "text": "One draft PR is created with a persisted delivery ID, exact source and base identity, a neutral title, and an Anvil-owned body section honoring the disclosure policy.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:draft-pr-create-and-reconcile:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "draft-pr-create-and-reconcile", "index": 2, "text": "Default disclosure excludes private issue descriptions, raw logs, prompts, local filesystem paths, credentials, and full configuration.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:draft-pr-create-and-reconcile:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "draft-pr-create-and-reconcile", "index": 3, "text": "On create timeout the unique delivery marker is searched across draft, open, closed, and merged states; zero matches allow bounded delayed reconciliation, multiple matches require attention, and no PR is adopted by branch name alone.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:draft-pr-create-and-reconcile:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "draft-pr-create-and-reconcile", "index": 4, "text": "Only the generated body section is edited, its last observed digest is compared before editing, and human-authored content is preserved.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:draft-pr-create-and-reconcile:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "draft-pr-create-and-reconcile", "index": 5, "text": "The publish command and the explicitly enabled on-success foreground pass both work, and a crash before confirmation leaves publication pending for a later sync.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:ready-promotion-and-checks:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "ready-promotion-and-checks", "index": 1, "text": "Required checks are identified by producer and context or key, must belong to the expected source head, and pending, unknown, or ambiguous producer identity blocks promotion.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:ready-promotion-and-checks:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "ready-promotion-and-checks", "index": 2, "text": "Anvil publishes its own local verification as a commit status under a stable context, and that status cannot satisfy an external check requirement.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:ready-promotion-and-checks:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "ready-promotion-and-checks", "index": 3, "text": "Ready promotion uses the documented provider mutation, requires current mergeability with no reported conflicts, and stays pending when mergeability is unknown.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:ready-promotion-and-checks:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "ready-promotion-and-checks", "index": 4, "text": "Base observations are recorded before promotion; a base advance refreshes mergeability and invalidates checks scoped to the old merge candidate, and a source head change invalidates source-head checks.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:ready-promotion-and-checks:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "ready-promotion-and-checks", "index": 5, "text": "The ready command applies exactly the same head, evidence, and check gates as automatic promotion and cannot bypass them.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:merge-observation-and-sync:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "merge-observation-and-sync", "index": 1, "text": "Merge is confirmed only from provider evidence tying the merged PR to the recorded source head and resulting target commit; a merge commit field on an open PR and a synthetic merge SHA are both insufficient.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:merge-observation-and-sync:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "merge-observation-and-sync", "index": 2, "text": "An unprovable association records merged-unverified, a closed PR records closed-unmerged, a human push to the PR source invalidates bound delivery evidence, and deletion of a branch after a valid merge does not invalidate persisted merge evidence.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:merge-observation-and-sync:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "merge-observation-and-sync", "index": 3, "text": "Review approval and change-request state is displayed without automatic repair, merge, or reversal.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed-revised"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:merge-observation-and-sync:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "merge-observation-and-sync", "index": 4, "text": "The sync command reconciles previously authorized operations, cannot turn a manual publication policy into automatic publication, does not resume execution, and in watch mode runs in the foreground with a finite timeout leaving pending work durable on exit.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:merge-observation-and-sync:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "merge-observation-and-sync", "index": 5, "text": "Exit codes are 0 for confirmed or nothing due, 1 for pending at deadline, 2 for invalid configuration or authorization, and 3 for a conflict requiring a decision; waiting for human merge is not a failure.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:bitbucket-code-host:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "bitbucket-code-host", "index": 1, "text": "Doctor, draft creation, ready promotion via native flags, source and destination commit observation, participant and change-request display, keyed build statuses, and merge reconciliation are implemented against a fake Bitbucket provider.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:bitbucket-code-host:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "bitbucket-code-host", "index": 2, "text": "Draft lookup and update recover correctly when a PR has already closed.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:bitbucket-code-host:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "bitbucket-code-host", "index": 3, "text": "Authentication supports scoped API tokens and access tokens; no onboarding path uses retired app passwords.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:bitbucket-code-host:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "bitbucket-code-host", "index": 4, "text": "The Bitbucket adapter passes the same contract suite as GitHub, including uncertain-write reconciliation and manifest-bound publication.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-mappings-and-started:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-mappings-and-started", "index": 1, "text": "Workflow mappings bind started, ready-for-review, and done to explicit permitted source states using pre-existing Anvil-owned labels; doctor resolves them and reports missing labels or permissions without creating anything.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed-revised"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-mappings-and-started:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-mappings-and-started", "index": 2, "text": "During execution the bounded integration loop performs tracker synchronization only, never waits on the repository lock while shutdown waits for the loop, and leaves remaining intents durable on process exit.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-mappings-and-started:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-mappings-and-started", "index": 3, "text": "An issue is marked started on first attempt claim, including the first member claim of an aggregate binding.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-mappings-and-started:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-mappings-and-started", "index": 4, "text": "Every mutation re-reads current external state first and treats an already-converged target as an observation rather than proof Anvil caused the change.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-mappings-and-started:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-mappings-and-started", "index": 5, "text": "Old pending started events are not replayed after a run has completed, and no issue is ever auto-reopened.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 1, "text": "Review-ready follows delivery ready promotion, and completion follows verified merge only for bindings declaring whole-issue coverage with every member delivered.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 2, "text": "A partial-issue binding publishes progress and links only and cannot change the whole issue's workflow state or phase labels.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 3, "text": "With links enabled, one ordinary PR link or one managed link comment is upserted using reconciled markers and IDs; progress comments stay off by default.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 4, "text": "Human cancellation, reopen, disallowed move, transfer outside approved scope, or a changed scope digest produces a precise conflict that suspends those writes, and nothing is reverted.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed-revised"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 5, "text": "An external closure without qualified delivery evidence records externally-closed-unverified and preserves local acceptance without reopening the issue.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:issue-review-ready-and-completion:6", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "issue-review-ready-and-completion", "index": 6, "text": "Only owned phase labels are added or removed; all other labels and human text are preserved.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:jira-lifecycle-sync:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "jira-lifecycle-sync", "index": 1, "text": "Transitions are applied by transition ID from the currently available set, never by status ID; required transition fields come from trusted configuration or the operation stops with a precise missing-field conflict.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed-revised"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:jira-lifecycle-sync:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "jira-lifecycle-sync", "index": 2, "text": "PR links are upserted as remote links with a deterministic global ID so retries do not duplicate.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:jira-lifecycle-sync:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "jira-lifecycle-sync", "index": 3, "text": "Human moves to unmapped states, cancellations, and reopens produce conflicts; nothing is reverted.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed-revised"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:jira-lifecycle-sync:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "jira-lifecycle-sync", "index": 4, "text": "The Jira adapter passes the same lifecycle contract tests as GitHub Issues.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:linear-lifecycle-sync:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "linear-lifecycle-sync", "index": 1, "text": "State changes update the issue state ID using the configured team-specific state; a wrong-team state ID is a precise conflict.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:linear-lifecycle-sync:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "linear-lifecycle-sync", "index": 2, "text": "PR links are upserted as attachments without duplication on retry.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:linear-lifecycle-sync:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "linear-lifecycle-sync", "index": 3, "text": "Mutation results are inspected for GraphQL errors and success flags even on HTTP 200.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:linear-lifecycle-sync:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "linear-lifecycle-sync", "index": 4, "text": "The Linear adapter passes the same lifecycle contract tests as GitHub Issues.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:six-way-contract-matrix:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "six-way-contract-matrix", "index": 1, "text": "A parametrized suite runs import, started, publish, review-ready, merge observation, and whole-issue completion for all six host and tracker combinations.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": true, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:six-way-contract-matrix:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "six-way-contract-matrix", "index": 2, "text": "Crash injection at projection, intent commit, push, PR create, link or comment create, workflow transition, and receipt commit converges or exposes uncertainty without duplicating PRs or comments or losing accepted work.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": true, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:six-way-contract-matrix:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "six-way-contract-matrix", "index": 3, "text": "Two concurrent sync processes, an active run plus manual sync, native resume, and cross-run ownership preserve single-writer rules and reject stale operations.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:six-way-contract-matrix:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "six-way-contract-matrix", "index": 4, "text": "Lost responses, 401, 403, 404, 409, 429, 5xx, GraphQL rate-limit errors, and revoked credentials retain actionable pending state; provider downtime never reruns models or changes local acceptance or learning.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:six-way-contract-matrix:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "six-way-contract-matrix", "index": 5, "text": "Squash, rebase, and merge commits, deleted merged branches, closed-unmerged PRs, unknown mergeability, and a synthetic merge SHA are distinguished from a confirmed merge.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-run-views:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-run-views", "index": 1, "text": "A standard-library HTTP server binds to loopback, picks a free port when asked for port 0, prints the session URL, runs in the foreground, and exits on interrupt without affecting workers or evidence.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-run-views:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-run-views", "index": 2, "text": "A per-session local token is exchanged for a scoped HTTP-only session; Host and Origin are validated, no permissive CORS is served, a restrictive content policy applies, and only packaged assets are served.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-run-views:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-run-views", "index": 3, "text": "Run list, run overview with dependency waves and active slots, and ticket detail with attempts, model and effort reasons, and selected skills render from the bounded query layer, polling about every two seconds for the active run and slower for the list.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-run-views:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-run-views", "index": 4, "text": "All routes are read-only; no endpoint runs, resumes, syncs, merges, or mutates anything, and useful CLI commands appear only as selectable text.", "procedure": "reading", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-run-views:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-run-views", "index": 5, "text": "Legacy runs without integration records render, unknown cost data is labeled unknown, and keyboard navigation, visible focus, accessible state labels, contrast, and a table alternative to the dependency graph are verified in a browser.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-delivery-evidence-views:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-delivery-evidence-views", "index": 1, "text": "The delivery view shows host, source and base refs and SHAs, PR URL, draft, review, check, and merge state, and the issue synchronization backlog and conflicts, keeping execution progress and delivered progress visually separate.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-delivery-evidence-views:2", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-delivery-evidence-views", "index": 2, "text": "The evidence view shows independent review findings, verification outcomes, the event timeline, and usage provenance, with artifacts resolved through allowlisted opaque IDs, traversal and symlinks rejected, and excerpts streamed up to 256 KiB.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-delivery-evidence-views:3", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-delivery-evidence-views", "index": 3, "text": "Issue text, comments, and logs render as escaped text or sanitized Markdown with raw HTML disabled; stored markup injection tests pass.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": true, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-delivery-evidence-views:4", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-delivery-evidence-views", "index": 4, "text": "The execution ledger and integration journal cursors are labeled so projection lag reads as lag, not contradiction, and stale observations show their last evidence time.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-delivery-evidence-views:5", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-delivery-evidence-views", "index": 5, "text": "Responses contain no credentials, authorization headers, environment contents, or hidden external content, and dashboard polling never triggers provider requests.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": true, "joins_claims": true, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
{"uid": "delivery-dashboard.json:dashboard-group-view:1", "file": "delivery-dashboard.json", "task": "dashboard-group-view", "index": 1, "text": "A group view lists each group's identity and kind, member issues with local, delivery, and tracker states, computed rollup counts, and the runs that touched each member, reading the state-root group index.", "procedure": "execution", "unbounded_absence": false, "joins_claims": false, "self_gradable": false, "labeled_by": "model-proposed"}
